{"unit_id":"tag:02YM:proof","translation":"为浸入（immersion）的性质在基变换（base change）下稳定，见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>。为浸入（immersion）的性质在底（base）上关于 Zariski 为局部（local）的。最后，设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）的满射（surjective）态射（morphism），且是平坦（flat）的、局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的。注意<MATH_0002>是开（open）的，见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>。设<MATH_0003>是态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0004>是浸入（immersion）。特别地，<MATH_0005>是局部闭（locally closed）的。因此，由《拓扑（Topology）》引理<REF_0003>知<MATH_0006>是局部闭（locally closed）的。令<MATH_0007>为闭子集（closed subset）<MATH_0008>。再次由《拓扑（Topology）》引理<REF_0004>知<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>中是闭（closed）的。因此，可以对 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）应用引理<REF_0005>，该覆盖为<MATH_0011>，从而得到<MATH_0012>是闭浸入（closed immersion）。换言之，<MATH_0013>是浸入（immersion）。因此，引理<REF_0006>适用，所需结论成立。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"im