{"unit_id":"tag:0H8J:proof","translation":"由《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>，支配（dominant）态射（morphisms）在沿开（open）态射（morphisms）的拉回（pullback）下保持，因而沿平坦（flat）的、局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的态射（morphisms）亦然（《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>）。另一个方向更容易。事实上，支配（dominant）这一性质显然在底（base）上关于 Zariski 为局部（local）的。接着，设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的满射（surjective）态射（morphism）（不必平坦（flat），也不必局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）），并设<MATH_0002>是态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>是支配（dominant）的。则<MATH_0004>是两个支配（dominant）态射（morphisms）的复合（composition），因而是支配（dominant）的。由于这也是复合（composition）<MATH_0005>，可知<MATH_0006>是支配（dominant）的。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表示"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","