{"unit_id":"tag:06NC:proof","translation":"由于<MATH_0001>是平坦（flat）、拟紧（quasi-compact）、满射（surjective）的态射（morphism），<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。对角（diagonal）<MATH_0004>是同构（isomorphism）（《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>）。这意味着<MATH_0005>沿<MATH_0006>的基变换（base change）是同构（isomorphism）。因此，<MATH_0007>是同构（isomorphism）（引理<REF_0002>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"给定态射的平坦性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"给定态射的拟紧性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"给定态射的满射性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定态射；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"由给定态射形成的覆盖；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角","context":"给定态射的对角；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"对角、基变换及原态射的性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章节名；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"沿态射自身的基变换；词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
